I'm going for a ride.

277
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,280
Wait.

278
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:57,680
I have a lot of scars on my legs.

279
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:01,960
I started wearing tights to hide them, and then I guess I just got used to it.

280
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:03,480
But scars?

281
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:07,160
Yeah, I, I was on the track team and I ran hurdles.

282
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:10,060
Except what I really did was trip on them.

283
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:14,980
My arms and upper body didn't suffer too much, but I scratched up my legs pretty badly.

284
00:16:14,980 --> 00:16:18,500
Hurdles, that is so cool!

285
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,440
So your scars are badges of honor!

286
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:22,420
Huh?

287
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:24,680
I'm so sorry!

288
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,020
Can't believe I said that!

289
00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:27,140
Wait, I'm so sorry!

290
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:32,140
Actually, it's flattering to hear you call them that.

291
00:16:32,780 --> 00:16:33,100
Huh?

292
00:16:33,100 --> 00:16:40,800
The track team at my middle school was absolutely huge, and I've never been the best at talking to people.

293
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:44,480
I never got especially close to any of my younger teammates, either.

294
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:51,160
Even after I joined the Karasuno Volleyball Club, it was a full two years before I had a junior manager.

295
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:55,400
So you're basically the first person I've been able to talk to in any real way.

296
00:16:56,400 --> 00:17:00,740
And well, I'm going to be graduating soon.

297
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:07,120
Tomorrow, after we win our first match, let's come back here for another bath.

298
00:17:12,060 --> 00:17:12,500
Yeah!

299
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:46,240
The Haruko National High School Volleyball Championship, also known as the Spring Nationals.

300
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,820
It's considered by some to be the koshien of volleyball.

301
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:54,300
It's the most highly anticipated high school volleyball tournament of the year.

302
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:03,020
We're here!

303
00:18:04,740 --> 00:18:07,460
The same stage where the Tiny Giant battled!

304
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:10,900
Well, the Tiny Giant you're talking about actually never competed here.

305
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:12,580
They played in Yo-Yogi back then.

306
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:13,760
Enough out of you!

307
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:14,240
Alright!

308
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:16,680
It has the same atmosphere and ambiance!

309
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:21,540
Can it be true?

310
00:18:22,300 --> 00:18:25,340
Could this be the lucky incident of lechery I've always dreamed of?

311
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,300
Otherwise known as...

312
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:28,940
The Lucky Lecture?

313
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,300
I'm sorry.

314
00:18:30,940 --> 00:18:32,880
There's nothing I can do to stop it.

315
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,000
Thank you, God.

316
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:37,700
Thank you, sweet Hinata.

317
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:40,180
Goodness, are you alright?

318
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:43,080
Yes, thanks!

319
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:43,940
I'm fine!

320
00:18:43,940 --> 00:18:46,560
Hey, is that you, Kanaka?

321
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,320
Good to see you!

322
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:49,980
Hello, Ryu!

323
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,260
It's been so long!

324
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:51,640
Huh?

325
00:18:52,740 --> 00:18:54,460
Are you telling me you know her?

326
00:18:54,620 --> 00:18:55,040
Yeah!

327
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:57,380
She's a wing spiker for Niyama High!

328
00:18:57,460 --> 00:18:58,280
How have you been?

329
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,980
Last time I saw you was fourth grade!

330
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:01,940
That's right.

331
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:04,920
I see you're just as big as, uh, ever!

332
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:08,720
She's...

333
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,520
Really matured.

334
00:19:11,300 --> 00:19:12,700
Tanaka's brain has collapsed.

335
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:17,020
I did think it was kind of weird to see him talking to a girl like it was a normal thing.

336
00:19:17,820 --> 00:19:21,180
Usually he would have already puked all over himself and fallen down.

337
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:23,140
He's embarrassing himself.

338
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,540
Anyway, good luck to both of us for you!

339
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:27,400
Uh, yeah, it's you!

340
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,140
Hey, Kageyama!

341
00:19:29,320 --> 00:19:30,000
It's good to see you!

342
00:19:30,140 --> 00:19:30,780
Oh, hey!

343
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,260
Check it out!

344
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:34,440
Looks like even Kageyama knows somebody here.

345
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,140
They must have met at that youth intensive.

346
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,000
I think that's Motoyakomori.

347
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:42,840
I saw him listed as the top liberal in monthly volleyball magazine.

348
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:46,000
Soksa didn't come here to the ceremony with you?

349
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:47,860
He's hiding over there.

350
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,400
Absolutely hates crowds.

351
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,080
I'm surprised he hasn't faded yet.

352
00:19:54,620 --> 00:19:55,900
Hey, hey, hey!

353
00:19:56,520 --> 00:19:57,720
Heal to my man!

354
00:19:58,020 --> 00:19:58,380
Bokuto!

355
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:02,440
Well, well, it seems like my number one pupil made it here after all!

356
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:05,000
Hinata, when he's an ass, you can tell him to shut up.

357
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:07,060
That's Bokuto from Fukurodani.

358
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:08,860
The guy seems like kind of a nutjob.

359
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,360
And who's that shrimp that he called his number one pupil?

360
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:14,460
I still won't go easy on you when we're across the net.

361
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,080
Good!

362
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:19,080
Oh, sookie!

363
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:19,740
Hey, man!

364
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:20,800
Sookie, sookie!

365
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:21,700
Lookie, lookie!

366
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:24,420
Oh, did you get taller?

367
00:20:24,420 --> 00:20:26,040
Oh, you can't get it, didn't you?

368
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:31,220
So, did you finally get a chance to see the real Skytree?

369
00:20:32,420 --> 00:20:33,480
Country bumpkins.

370
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:34,880
We did.

371
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:36,440
Well, well, well.

372
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,920
Don't tell me you're getting nervous, my dear Daichin.

373
00:20:39,300 --> 00:20:43,500
I believe you're talking too much is a sign of your nervousness, Kuro, my friend.

374
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:47,320
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for your patience.

375
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:53,240
We will now begin the opening ceremonies for the Haruko National High School Volleyball Championship.

376
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:56,360
I ask you now to direct your attention to the main floor.

377
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:04,500
The championship flags are now entering the stadium.

378
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:09,380
Please welcome the teams representing each of the 47 prefectures of Japan.

379
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:12,700
From Hokkaido, first representative, Boyd.

380
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:14,920
We can't expect the boys to not be restless.

381
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:18,220
But you at least need to be calm, right, coach?

382
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:20,060
Yes, I know I am calm!

383
00:21:20,180 --> 00:21:24,840
Blighter, second representative, Boyd, Morikawa High School, and the ladies.

384
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:26,240
Need the bathroom again?

385
00:21:26,460 --> 00:21:27,620
No, I do not!

386
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:31,400
Miyagi Prefecture, representatives.

387
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:40,480
Boys, Karasuno High School.

388
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:45,500
Girls, Niyama Girls High School.

389
00:21:47,700 --> 00:21:49,500
Fukushima Prefecture, representatives.

390
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:52,140
Boys, Furukata High School.

391
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:54,820
Girls, Iwaki Girls High School.

392
00:21:54,820 --> 00:22:14,760
This is it.

393
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:21,060
It's the battle on the Orange Court!

394
00:22:21,060 --> 00:22:24,080
play Mutta.

395
00:22:28,060 --> 00:22:34,080
Address 06 becomes pride in219.

396
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:35,380
If you don't feel Eh Podian reopob disturbs, you need it.

397
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:37,260
Episode 8, 5,3 is not true.

398
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:39,720
exaggeration to inspire people and you know that.

399
00:22:39,780 --> 00:22:40,100
仏li rei police in30 to 06.

400
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:40,800
Dena'sок MRT 3 is not fair, it could be complacent.

401
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:46,000
神様の助けはいらない

402
